// Template for the source-bound deferred Play fixture. run_sleep_timer.py replaces every
// //@EXTRACT line with the named member copied from production source, then compiles the
// result with the real PurpleSleepTimerRules. The session callbacks, the lazy-load and
// prepare helper, the timestamp scheduling block, the timer facade, Audio classification
// and MediaController.playMessage are production text. The classes here supply only inert
// platform endpoints (storage loads, the stock player, the viewer and the UI queue).
